{"id":"b90ce24ffe5c0b26","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/634_计算树逻辑_CTL.md","title":"634 计算树逻辑 CTL","display":"634_计算树逻辑_CTL","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{EX},\\operatorname{AX},\\operatorname{EU},\\operatorname{AU}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{EX},\\operatorname{AX},\\operatorname{EU},\\operatorname{AU}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"EXA,\\quad AXA,\\quad E[A\\,U\\,B],\\quad A[A\\,U\\,B].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[EXA,\\quad AXA,\\quad E[A\\,U\\,B],\\quad A[A\\,U\\,B].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad EFA=E[\\top\\,U\\,A],\\quad AFA=A[\\top\\,U\\,A].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad EFA=E[\\top\\,U\\,A],\\quad AFA=A[\\top\\,U\\,A].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"EXA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\">\\(EXA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"AXA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\">\\(AXA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E[A\\,U\\,B]\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\">\\(E[A\\,U\\,B]\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[A\\,U\\,B]\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\">\\(A[A\\,U\\,B]\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元\">3. 自由变元</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(EXA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(AXA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(EXA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(AXA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(E[A\\,U\\,B])=\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(E[A\\,U\\,B])=\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(A[A\\,U\\,B])=\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(A[A\\,U\\,B])=\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{634}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{634}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{634}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{634}\">\\(\\mathsf{Subst}_{634}\\)</span> 为所有有限支撑函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\)</span> 的集合，其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}_{634}(\\sigma)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{supp}_{634}(\\sigma)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>是有限集。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{634}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{634}\\)</span> 唯一扩张为类型化函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{634}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{634}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(EXA)=EX\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(A),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(AXA)=AX\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(EXA)=EX\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(A),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(AXA)=AX\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(E[A\\,U\\,B])=E[\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(A)\\,U\\,\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(B)],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(E[A\\,U\\,B])=E[\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(A)\\,U\\,\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(B)],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(A[A\\,U\\,B])=A[\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(A)\\,U\\,\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(B)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(A[A\\,U\\,B])=A[\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(A)\\,U\\,\\widehat\\sigma_{634}(B)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,634}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,634}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题三族与 CTL 公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{AXDual}^{634}=\\{AXA\\leftrightarrow\\neg EX\\neg A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{AXDual}^{634}=\\{AXA\\leftrightarrow\\neg EX\\neg A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{EUFix}^{634}=\\{E[A\\,U\\,B]\\leftrightarrow(B\\lor(A\\land EXE[A\\,U\\,B])):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{EUFix}^{634}=\\{E[A\\,U\\,B]\\leftrightarrow(B\\lor(A\\land EXE[A\\,U\\,B])):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{AUFix}^{634}=\\{A[A\\,U\\,B]\\leftrightarrow(B\\lor(A\\land AXA[A\\,U\\,B])):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{AUFix}^{634}=\\{A[A\\,U\\,B]\\leftrightarrow(B\\lor(A\\land AXA[A\\,U\\,B])):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{634}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{634}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{634}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{634}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{634}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{634}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{634}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{634}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{634}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{634}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AXDual}^{634}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{EUFix}^{634}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AUFix}^{634}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{634}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{634}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{634}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{634}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AXDual}^{634}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{EUFix}^{634}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{AUFix}^{634}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{634}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{634}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecAX}^{634}=\\{((A),AXA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecAX}^{634}=\\{((A),AXA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{634}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{634}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecAX}^{634}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{634}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{634}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecAX}^{634}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>不注册由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\to(B\\lor(A\\land EXC))\">\\(C\\to(B\\lor(A\\land EXC))\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\to(B\\lor(A\\land AXC))\">\\(C\\to(B\\lor(A\\land AXC))\\)</span> 直接推出强 until 的规则；这些后固定点条件允许沿无限分支永远停留在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land C\">\\(A\\land C\\)</span>，不能保证出现 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>定义证明行载体</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Line}_{634}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{634})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Line}_{634}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{634})\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义证明对象函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{634}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{634})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\n\\bigcup_{\\substack{m\\in\\mathbb N\\\\m&gt;0}}\n\\mathsf{Line}_{634}^{\\,m}\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Proof}_{634}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{634})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\n\\bigcup_{\\substack{m\\in\\mathbb N\\\\m&gt;0}}\n\\mathsf{Line}_{634}^{\\,m}\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{634}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{634}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 由所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>组成，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 至少满足下列一项：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{634}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{634}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=AXA_j\">\\(A_i=AXA_j\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{634}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{634}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{634}(\\Gamma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{634}(\\Gamma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_{m-1}=A\n\\quad\\text{且}\\quad\n\\Delta_{m-1}\\subseteq\\Gamma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_{m-1}=A\n\\quad\\text{且}\\quad\n\\Delta_{m-1}\\subseteq\\Gamma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{634}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{634}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{634}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{634}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>CTL 的目标差异是路径量词与时态算子结合成状态公式构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"EX,AX,E[U],A[U]\">\\(EX,AX,E[U],A[U]\\)</span>；本文件不允许任意嵌套的路径公式类别。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-分支时间结构\">10. 分支时间结构</h1>\n<p>定义 CTL 结构集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Model}_{634}\">\\(\\mathsf{Model}_{634}\\)</span>。一个元素为三元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M=(S,R,V)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M=(S,R,V)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\ne\\varnothing,\\qquad R\\subseteq S\\times S,\\qquad V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(S),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\ne\\varnothing,\\qquad R\\subseteq S\\times S,\\qquad V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(S),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 是全关系：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall s\\in S\\ \\exists t\\in S\\ (s,t)\\in R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall s\\in S\\ \\exists t\\in S\\ (s,t)\\in R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义状态对象载体</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{StateObj}_{634}\n=\n\\{(M,s):M=(S,R,V)\\in\\mathsf{Model}_{634},\\ s\\in S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{StateObj}_{634}\n=\n\\{(M,s):M=(S,R,V)\\in\\mathsf{Model}_{634},\\ s\\in S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,s)\\in\\mathsf{StateObj}_{634}\">\\((M,s)\\in\\mathsf{StateObj}_{634}\\)</span>，定义最大路径谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MaxPath}_{634}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{StateObj}_{634}\\times\n\\bigcup_{M=(S,R,V)\\in\\mathsf{Model}_{634}}S^{\\mathbb N}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MaxPath}_{634}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{StateObj}_{634}\\times\n\\bigcup_{M=(S,R,V)\\in\\mathsf{Model}_{634}}S^{\\mathbb N}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MaxPath}_{634}(M,s,\\rho)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\rho:\\mathbb N\\to S\\wedge\\rho(0)=s\\wedge\n\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\ ((\\rho(i),\\rho(i+1))\\in R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MaxPath}_{634}(M,s,\\rho)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\rho:\\mathbb N\\to S\\wedge\\rho(0)=s\\wedge\n\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\ ((\\rho(i),\\rho(i+1))\\in R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其定义域为全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>，故路径不能再延伸，正是本文件采用的最大路径。定义从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 出发的路径集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Path}_{634}(M,s)\n=\n\\{\\rho:\\mathbb N\\to S:\\operatorname{MaxPath}_{634}(M,s,\\rho)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Path}_{634}(M,s)\n=\n\\{\\rho:\\mathbb N\\to S:\\operatorname{MaxPath}_{634}(M,s,\\rho)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此每个 CTL 路径量词的语义域是集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PathObj}_{634}=\\{(M,s,\\rho):M\\in\\mathsf{Model}_{634},\\ s\\in S,\\ \\rho\\in\\operatorname{Path}_{634}(M,s)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{PathObj}_{634}=\\{(M,s,\\rho):M\\in\\mathsf{Model}_{634},\\ s\\in S,\\ \\rho\\in\\operatorname{Path}_{634}(M,s)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(S,R,V)\">\\(M=(S,R,V)\\)</span> 的状态集。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-满足关系\">11. 满足关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{634}\\subseteq\n\\{(M,s,A):M=(S,R,V)\\in\\mathsf{Model}_{634},\\ s\\in S,\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Vdash_{634}\\subseteq\n\\{(M,s,A):M=(S,R,V)\\in\\mathsf{Model}_{634},\\ s\\in S,\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为满足下列递归子句的最小关系。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,s\\Vdash_{634}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ns\\in V(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,s\\Vdash_{634}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ns\\in V(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,s\\not\\Vdash_{634}\\bot.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,s\\not\\Vdash_{634}\\bot.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,s\\Vdash_{634}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nM,s\\not\\Vdash_{634}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,s\\Vdash_{634}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nM,s\\not\\Vdash_{634}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,s\\Vdash_{634}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nM,s\\not\\Vdash_{634}A\\ \\text{或}\\ M,s\\Vdash_{634}B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,s\\Vdash_{634}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nM,s\\not\\Vdash_{634}A\\ \\text{或}\\ M,s\\Vdash_{634}B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,s\\Vdash_{634}EXA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists t\\in S\\ ((s,t)\\in R\\wedge M,t\\Vdash_{634}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,s\\Vdash_{634}EXA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists t\\in S\\ ((s,t)\\in R\\wedge M,t\\Vdash_{634}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,s\\Vdash_{634}AXA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall t\\in S\\ ((s,t)\\in R\\to M,t\\Vdash_{634}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,s\\Vdash_{634}AXA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall t\\in S\\ ((s,t)\\in R\\to M,t\\Vdash_{634}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,s\\Vdash_{634}E[A\\,U\\,B]\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Path}_{634}(M,s)\\ \\exists j\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(M,\\rho(j)\\Vdash_{634}B\\wedge\n\\forall h&lt;j\\ M,\\rho(h)\\Vdash_{634}A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,s\\Vdash_{634}E[A\\,U\\,B]\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Path}_{634}(M,s)\\ \\exists j\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(M,\\rho(j)\\Vdash_{634}B\\wedge\n\\forall h&lt;j\\ M,\\rho(h)\\Vdash_{634}A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,s\\Vdash_{634}A[A\\,U\\,B]\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Path}_{634}(M,s)\\ \\exists j\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(M,\\rho(j)\\Vdash_{634}B\\wedge\n\\forall h&lt;j\\ M,\\rho(h)\\Vdash_{634}A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,s\\Vdash_{634}A[A\\,U\\,B]\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Path}_{634}(M,s)\\ \\exists j\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(M,\\rho(j)\\Vdash_{634}B\\wedge\n\\forall h&lt;j\\ M,\\rho(h)\\Vdash_{634}A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"12.-语义后果\">12. 语义后果</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}\\)</span>，定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{634}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{634}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(S,R,V)\\in\\mathsf{Model}_{634}\">\\(M=(S,R,V)\\in\\mathsf{Model}_{634}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in S\">\\(s\\in S\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ M,s\\Vdash_{634}B\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\nM,s\\Vdash_{634}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ M,s\\Vdash_{634}B\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\nM,s\\Vdash_{634}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{634}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}:\\varnothing\\models_{634}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{634}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{634}:\\varnothing\\models_{634}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"13.-整个形式系统\">13. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{CTL}_{634}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{634},\\operatorname{FV}_{634},\\operatorname{BV}_{634},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{634},\\widehat\\sigma_{634},\\equiv_{\\alpha,634},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{634},\\mathsf{Rule}_{634},\\mathsf{Proof}_{634},\\vdash_{634},\\mathsf{Thm}_{634}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{CTL}_{634}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{634},\\operatorname{FV}_{634},\\operatorname{BV}_{634},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{634},\\widehat\\sigma_{634},\\equiv_{\\alpha,634},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{634},\\mathsf{Rule}_{634},\\mathsf{Proof}_{634},\\vdash_{634},\\mathsf{Thm}_{634}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>扩展后的完整对象为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{CTL}^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{634}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{634},\\operatorname{FV}_{634},\\operatorname{BV}_{634},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{634},\\widehat\\sigma_{634},\\equiv_{\\alpha,634},\n\\mathsf{Model}_{634},\\mathsf{StateObj}_{634},\\operatorname{MaxPath}_{634},\\operatorname{Path}_{634},\\mathsf{PathObj}_{634},\\Vdash_{634},\\models_{634},\\mathsf{Val}_{634},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{634},\\mathsf{Rule}_{634},\\mathsf{Line}_{634},\\mathsf{Proof}_{634},\\vdash_{634},\\mathsf{Thm}_{634}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{CTL}^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{634}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{634},\\operatorname{FV}_{634},\\operatorname{BV}_{634},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{634},\\widehat\\sigma_{634},\\equiv_{\\alpha,634},\n\\mathsf{Model}_{634},\\mathsf{StateObj}_{634},\\operatorname{MaxPath}_{634},\\operatorname{Path}_{634},\\mathsf{PathObj}_{634},\\Vdash_{634},\\models_{634},\\mathsf{Val}_{634},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{634},\\mathsf{Rule}_{634},\\mathsf{Line}_{634},\\mathsf{Proof}_{634},\\vdash_{634},\\mathsf{Thm}_{634}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含 CTL 状态公式、公理、证明对象与全转移结构上的路径语义；不含模型检测算法、二叉决策图表示或完备性证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元","text":"3. 自由变元","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则关系","text":"6. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-分支时间结构","text":"10. 分支时间结构","level":1},{"id":"11.-满足关系","text":"11. 满足关系","level":1},{"id":"12.-语义后果","text":"12. 语义后果","level":1},{"id":"13.-整个形式系统","text":"13. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{